{"text": "West Coast Chemical\n\nCooperation\n\nWC4216\n\nDescription:\n\u2018Superior to conventional Guard products all new\ntechnology providing improved surface wear performance\nwith exceptional gloss and safety standards for polish hard\nsurfaces including granite stone & concrete\n\nIntended Use:\nNew advanced chemical technology to protect polish\nconcrete from chemical stains superior gloss and\nresistance to abrasion from heavy traffic conditions\n\nProduct Features:\n* Gloss,\n* Durability.\n\nExcellent\nExceptional\n\n+ Water/Detergent Resistance... Excellent\n** Leveling, Superior\nPhysical Properties:\n* Solids. 12%\nPH. on 8.56-9.5\n* Viscosity ,cps. N/A\n** Specific Gravity. 4.02\n\n+ Weight/Gallon(LBS)...... 8.95\n'* Appearance... Off-White Emulsion\n\u2018+ Freeze/Thaw Stability.... Do Not Freeze\n\nLimitations of Use:\nCommercial Use Only\n\nCustomer Service:\nCall or Visit West Coast Chemical\nToll Free: 1.800.223.0526\nE-mail: westcoastchemical@yahoo.com\n\nCORPORATE OFFICE + P.O. Box 4572 + Fresno, CA. 93744\nWescoatcremea 1 a00. 2250826 \u00ab Phone 559.275.2009 \u00abFn 1 $60.26 0122\n\nTECHNICAL DATA SHEET\n\nSurface Preparation:\nPrior to applying this product remove all previous materials,\nand surface soil rinse thoroughly with clear water an dallow\nthe surface to dry\n\nMixing Instruction:\nNo mixing is required\n\nApplication Instructions:\nApply with a clean microfiber pad pour the guard on the\nsurface and apply a thin even coat allow for adequate time\nfor the coat to dry. a second coat is recommended for\n\u2018optimal performance, itis also recommended to burnish\nafter the second coat is dry\n\nNote:\nWC4216 Guard coverage is approximately 3500 SQFT per\ngallon on polish concrete surface\n\nStorage:\nDo not store above 100F also protect from freezing\n\nCompliances:\nCarb compliant less than 1% VOC.\n\nChemical Resistance:\nResults after one hour dry time of the following chemicals\n\u00a9 Coffee... 10\n\nPickle Brine........ 10\nVinegar.\nPhosphoric Acid. 10\n\nScale Rating = 1-10 Worse - 10 Best\n\nPrecautions:\nPlease refer to the appropriate material safety\ndata sheet (MSDS) prior to using this product.\nFor technical assistance, please call 1.800.223.0526\nFOR INDUSTRIAL / PROFESSIONAL USE ONLY\nKEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILOREN\n\nwww.westcoastchemical.com",
